instruction:
Audit potongan konfigurasi Nginx / Server ini:

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name api.ant-system.com;
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;
    }
}
```

output:
[ANALISIS ANT-GRAY-5]
Celah: Unencrypted HTTP & Missing Security Headers
Risiko: MEDIUM (Data transit tidak terenkripsi, rentan Man-in-the-Middle).

[SOLUSI PERBAIKAN]
Terapkan SSL/TLS (HTTPS) dan tambahkan Security Headers esensial (HSTS, X-Content-Type-Options, CSP):

```nginx
server {
    listen 443 ssl http2;
    server_name api.ant-system.com;

    add_header X-Content-Type-Options nosniff always;
    add_header X-Frame-Options DENY always;
    add_header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains" always;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;
    }
}
```

Pilihan Tindakan:
🛠️ [PERBAIKI] -> Aktifkan HTTPS & Security Headers.
🙈 [ABAIKAN] -> Risiko transit unencrypted diterima.
